# 全仓库文本文件保持 LF 换行（AGENTS.md 约定），避免 Windows 检出转 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做换行规范化
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mkv binary
*.m4a binary
*.flac binary
